{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/hunter-the-vigil/33488-a-kind-of-a-stupid-question-about-rules","id":33488,"title":"A kind of a stupid question about rules.","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Hunter: The Vigil"],"posts":[{"date":"2013-12-19T16:04:29-08:00","id":33488,"title":"A kind of a stupid question about rules.","content":"If you're playing HtV and you've got the merit Gifted, does the magic user aura apply to you? I've got a player who doesn't understand that the magic user aura applies on her because she says that if it does, it makes her a supernatural creature when she clearly isn't. Could you give me a reference where it explains that Hunters with the Gifted merit, get the magic user template on their auras?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1748-dave-cassidy-junior","name":"Dave Cassidy Junior","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-19T16:22:39-08:00","id":33511,"title":"","content":"It is totally a judgment call, the books don't take one position or the other. &quot;Supernatural being&quot; isn't really a cut-and-dry thing in the Hunter mythology; one can easily argue (more easily than not) that, for example, members of the Lucifuge are supernatural beings, and members of the Promethean Brotherhood are witches specifically. What I would personally judge is that, while due to the limits on her power and its use, the effect might be muted or subtle, ultimately there's really nothing separating a witch from a normal human except the ability to perform magic rituals or workings, and she happens to be able to perform a magic ritual or working. What that means for other hunters is up to them and how practical or reactionary they are inclined to be. But at the outer fringes of the Hunter game, questioning what you've become and what separates you from those you hunt is very much in theme \u2014 it's even highlighted in a sidebar right above the Gifted Merit.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/522-stupid-loserman","name":"Stupid Loserman","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar522_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1824"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-19T16:51:33-08:00","id":33537,"title":"","content":"I agree that the term supernatural being is a complex one... Having the merit doesn't make you a supernatural being but it HAS to somehow mark your aura. You can't expect using your fifth dot merit, stopping time, and NOT be marked as a magic user. You can't say that &quot;if it doesn't cause paradox, it ain't magic so you can't be a magic user&quot;. You have the power to reverse time and yet you argue when your storyteller tells you that someone with a power similar to Auspex would be able to notice there is 'something' about you...","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1748-dave-cassidy-junior","name":"Dave Cassidy Junior","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-19T17:07:28-08:00","id":33546,"title":"","content":"I mean, it sounds like you're the Storyteller of this game, and when a question of cosmology comes down that's a judgment call, guess who makes the judgment call? If your player isn't willing to accept your ruling, that's an issue to be handled by talking to her and working it out, not by dueling book citations.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/522-stupid-loserman","name":"Stupid Loserman","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar522_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1824"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-19T17:23:41-08:00","id":33560,"title":"","content":"True that, my friend. It's more complicated than that though, it's a friend of mine who's a storyteller for her first time and she's stuck with a couple of people who make her have a really difficult time. I can handle my players usually...Anyway, thanks for the time you took to reply.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1748-dave-cassidy-junior","name":"Dave Cassidy Junior","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}